Hi Kamil,

Thank you for reaching out and for the detailed explanation of CMLP. It sou=
nds like a very interesting project.

Based on your description, I believe our API is likely the best starting po=
int, though I'd like to understand your platform a little better before rec=
ommending the most appropriate licensing model.

Would you mind clarifying a few points?
- Will your platform generate new music on demand for each customer, or wil=
l you build a catalog of tracks that multiple customers can access?
- Will your customers be able to select or customize music themselves, or w=
ill your platform handle music selection automatically?
- Will the music be streamed directly from your platform to the businesses,=
 or will customers download tracks for playback?
- Approximately how many business locations do you expect to support during=
 your initial rollout?
- Which countries do you plan to launch in first?
Once I have a better understanding of your workflow, I'll be able to advise=
 on the most suitable licensing model and answer your questions regarding s=
ublicensing, public performance, and territorial scope more precisely.

If it's easier, I'm also happy to discuss everything over a quick call. You=
 can book a time that works for you here:

https://calendar.app.google/6MpEnoaqryHb2i9U9
Looking forward to hearing more about CMLP.

Best regards,
Leo
